  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Anti-Corruption for Development Partners 2024</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Anti-korruption f&#xF6;r utvecklingspartners 2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Corruption is a widespread issue faced by all sectors in North Macedonia, including development cooperation. To reduce the risks to which Swedish development cooperation partners are exposed to, and to help them recognize and tackle corruption, the Swedish Embassy has procured a cycle of workshops with an external anti-corruption expert, helping organizations to review and strengthen their internal controls and improve their practices.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Korruption &#xE4;r en utbredd fr&#xE5;ga som alla sektorer i Nordmakedonien st&#xE5;r inf&#xF6;r, inklusive utvecklingssamarbete. F&#xF6;r att minska de risker som svenska utvecklingssamarbetspartner uts&#xE4;tts f&#xF6;r, och f&#xF6;r att hj&#xE4;lpa dem att k&#xE4;nna igen och ta itu med korruption, har svenska ambassaden upphandlat en cykel av workshops med en extern anti-korruptionsexpert, som hj&#xE4;lper organisationer att se &#xF6;ver och st&#xE4;rka sina interna kontroller och f&#xF6;rb&#xE4;ttra sina metoder.</narrative>
  </description>
